{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_title", "source_sha256": "cfbb7f458ef202cf572997203428c3a204b46be46268827f3ca0af7f6ca5c35b", "ja": "いちばん大事なこと", "zh": "最重要的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_synopsis", "source_sha256": "aed7fc6e24cd4b6919951e0203e99fd1b1b1469f46d326f697ca8a3a721d8b8c", "ja": "初センターに選ばれた未来。ウキウキ気分も\nつかの間、センターとして何をすればいいの\nかわからず戸惑ってしまう。だが春香やプロ\nデューサーの言葉をヒントに迷いを振り切り\nいざステージへ……！", "zh": "未来第一次被选为Center，然而兴奋期待\n只持续了片刻，她不知道Center该做什么，\n为此感到十分困惑。但春香和制作人的话点醒\n了她，让她挥别烦恼，顺利登上舞台……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07e228c7e74ced3df4326e708fc19751547d5f05ab9d6824afca2252043692bf", "ja": "（次の公演、センターは未来に決まった。\nさて、未来の様子は……と）", "zh": "（下次公演已经决定让未来当Center了。\n好，就去看看她状况如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "c5d8a9ab1236aafd4fd9183f4851a1827f24dc9b73639ecab1e0f5fa98fdfaa6", "ja": "センター、センター♪　でへへ～……。\n……あれ？　センターって、何すればいいのかな？", "zh": "Center、Center♪嘿嘿～\n……奇怪？Center需要做什么啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "b8de77c9e9e2f809aec0420e66fd37c03421d92a451666d9f294c29af06c13a5", "ja": "未来……。まさか、センターが\n何をするかわからないまま、喜んでたの？", "zh": "未来……你该不会连Center要做什么都不知道，\n就开心成那样了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "863a4517548a88b826fe4ccca92a0bbbaec8b1ca6a2e6863183837c5f7e0b443", "ja": "え？　えっと～。\nうん……。", "zh": "咦？那个～\n嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3bd3442dc461c9cd90b50245963796aa15e13cda778f687ad1dc14adb423c29d", "ja": "センターなんだから、真ん中で歌えばいいんでしょ？\n簡単だよ♪", "zh": "因为是Center，站在中间唱歌就可以了吧？\n这很简单♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "a0857d43eaf62c36a16a751cc313529557ed6584b205276c7fc57643d79cf22c", "ja": "もう、翼ったら。そんな簡単な話じゃないわよ。\nだってセンターよ、センター。", "zh": "翼真是的，事情没有那么单纯。\n毕竟是Center，Center喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "bf70637c35a9037088bb901439e3ae24278adf28b210c0af726fc867864b93b9", "ja": "アイドルになったら、当然、\n目指すもののひとつでしょう？", "zh": "那是成为偶像后，\n一定会追求的目标之一吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "8eb58ee4b830d0c0a638100ee6b04701d8255b82b8100165739b75165612a0a0", "ja": "そっかー……。センターになるのって、\nすっごく大事なことなんだね……。", "zh": "这样啊……成为Center，\n感觉是件很不得了的事呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1008_p", "source_sha256": "950b52c8c46de37d1722216cc2ad7609c07a17f0a2ad2afd8bd0d5255d343f51", "ja": "どうした？　未来。\nやけに落ち込んだ顔してるみたいだけど。", "zh": "怎么了？未来。\n一副闷闷不乐的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "cc8f2be21e42cccfed94a787127dd7f2085f5b33eafda59a4ffb48f42f60bd62", "ja": "{$P$}さぁん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "aec9f7161f15e56b6e439eb835e8be18de81b1cae4897220b4271600fe8e6d97", "ja": "私、センターに指名してもらいましたけど。\n何をすればいいか、わからなくなっちゃいました……。", "zh": "我虽然被指名当Center，\n却完全不知道该怎么做才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
