{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2012_001har", "source_sha256": "a4bd274b6beab660364822e3137a38b2665eeb6bbe950deddbda54175a5fed6e", "ja": "えっと……。\nこのシーン、主人公は悩んでいるところだから……。", "zh": "这边是……\n这一幕是主角正觉得很烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
