{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2022_015siz", "source_sha256": "6173e1c92af57bd1d806e248f384d9be52072c63f22e4f3e80dcfc264fa15357", "ja": "ど、どうして私なのよ！？\n未来がセンターなんだから、未来がかけなさいよ！", "zh": "为、为什么是我去！？\n要当Center的是未来，未来你去问啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
