{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2027_015siz", "source_sha256": "b4cd27630aa9715b0fd5898d9985ab4a49eb413958088986c68c533843153f6f", "ja": "あの、すみません。うるさかったですか？\n台本を読んでいたの、邪魔しちゃったりとか……。", "zh": "那个，抱歉，我们刚刚很吵吗？\n是不是打扰到你读剧本了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2028_001har", "source_sha256": "d2d9be4e0ad32dd6580daeccbaf08b7797d23abd4a964eb74bb3f5422a055d13", "ja": "ううん、大丈夫だよ♪　もうそろそろ、\n出かけなくちゃって思ってたところだから。", "zh": "没事的，别放在心上♪\n我也差不多该出门了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2029_001har", "source_sha256": "f6c47199e1dd09970a28def9b3c84d02f6c03110efec4b66bdf6f046a4829363", "ja": "それより、{$P$}さんまで……？\n何かあったんですか？", "zh": "先不说这个，怎么连{$P$}先生\n也在？有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2030_p", "source_sha256": "d83948dffd8a3a4f5a282891f7d1bbd35876ef113514bd2a3113f2ca20480172", "ja": "ああ。みんなが、春香に\n聞きたいことがあるっていうから、ついてきたんだ。", "zh": "是啊，大家有些事想问春香，\n所以我也跟她们一起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2031_001har", "source_sha256": "dda4823aeb96ed15b68afce5825070e65e2e1c9ef5eebe3ab7ebbf0121b72278", "ja": "私に、聞きたいこと……？", "zh": "有些事想问我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2032_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2033_001har", "source_sha256": "c336c4b5f50640620138eaa54a5915e6343f9156ccb6f8154d624bff1abf0d0c", "ja": "そうなんだ。もちろん、\n私にわかることなら、なんでも答えるよ！", "zh": "这样啊，当然没问题。\n只要是我知道的事，都会尽力回答！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2034_014mir", "source_sha256": "39b310a7a8f6c6fe1ae944f406df4583ce11169be66f0f6e73513bf8a8126081", "ja": "あの、あの、春香さん！\n……センターって、何をすればいいんですか！？", "zh": "请、请问，春香！\n……Center该做些什么才好！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2035_001har", "source_sha256": "ae7201cf8122640f1156b0e18ae127503f127720ac467841561c7f1c74e85bc7", "ja": "センター？", "zh": "Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2036_014mir", "source_sha256": "a885d3b922c798d3ffb0e9a43d14b694948e5b00782ba28e64c896838a05bf13", "ja": "次の公演で、私、センターをやることになったんです！\nでも何をすればいいのか、全然わからなくて……。", "zh": "我将在下次的公演担任Center！\n但我完全不知道该怎么做……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2037_001har", "source_sha256": "1eb7da40e9646f51611168ef3f7c9d2146c695ffd07a93e866076504908af291", "ja": "わぁ、そうなんだ！？\nえへへっ、やったね、未来ちゃん♪", "zh": "哇，原来是这样啊！？\n嘿嘿，真是太好了，未来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2038_014mir", "source_sha256": "f4907fded9d18262052f3feb21ad75f8335e01ed98e06d3c240cfff47947e9c4", "ja": "でへへ……ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2039_014mir", "source_sha256": "56d46c22bbda936edded209861fb6a979a114f378d238760ab41d38ec11f7819", "ja": "私、センターって初めてなんですけど！\nライブって、すっごく楽しいですよね～！", "zh": "虽然这是我第一次当Center！\n但演唱会真的很开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2040_015siz", "source_sha256": "10a8b47065cd53458eb3ab8c91cc1137b6aa49524de0d08c9af193e4aef596d2", "ja": "初センターなんだから、当たり前じゃない……。", "zh": "这是你第一次当Center，会这么想也很正常吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2041_001har", "source_sha256": "2e56ae6126de7dc07c68c8fa946b6ff5589d487121f72fd98a6c664688568d11", "ja": "うん、そうだね。\nねぇ未来ちゃん、ライブは好き？", "zh": "嗯，说得也是。\n未来，我问你喔，你喜欢演唱会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2042_014mir", "source_sha256": "2f3a468f166812d38a37963f168df331eee9c7ba63c8c2a05c66ba7e3132836a", "ja": "はい、大好きです！\nもっともっと、みんなと歌いたいって思います♪", "zh": "喜欢，最喜欢了！\n我想要和大家一起唱更多更多歌♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2043_001har", "source_sha256": "5c004248ab4a23d6946e29e941d72492ee10fbc59e2408d5e07dcd0e7f09593f", "ja": "それじゃ、センターで大事なことだけど……\nやっぱり、周りをよく見ることかな？", "zh": "那么，当Center最重要的事……\n果然还是要仔细观察周遭吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2044_001har", "source_sha256": "6f5531e612c37a5b863a39a89e0d5e9a5c675101b8d4288b18a23b0a6624f656", "ja": "ステージでは、その日センターの人が、\nみんなの支えになるから…。", "zh": "舞台上那天担任Center的人，\n将会成为大家的支柱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2045_014mir", "source_sha256": "5b9ceeb9049b3e4094a552925962abc5dcb9d4b17689529118fee0f0621a9cc6", "ja": "ふんふん。\n周りをよく見る……。", "zh": "嗯嗯。\n仔细观察周遭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2046_001har", "source_sha256": "03ec59816046a1a870f070c185ac3c90d54dbeabc6581f1b030a8d1a751a95de", "ja": "もちろん、ステージの上だけじゃなくてね！\n控え室なんかでも、声を掛けたり。", "zh": "当然不只是在舞台上而已！\n在准备室时也要关心大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2047_001har", "source_sha256": "8a57460e59e4d1dc3aa47460e9c8e0b4ab47b64090c1885aa18ac336239acf19", "ja": "私の場合は、みんな、緊張してないかなーって\n様子を見に行くことが多いかな？", "zh": "如果是我，应该会多观察大家，\n看是不是有人很紧张。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2048_001har", "source_sha256": "cf9eb385510cfe41acf925fe149c49651dbc94e90f7c4b15a39cb18e7ac5c6e1", "ja": "ちょっとしたことだけど、声を掛けられると、\n気持ちが楽になったりするから。けっこう大事かも！", "zh": "虽然只是件微不足道的小事，但有时候和人聊一聊，\n心情就会轻松一点，所以算挺重要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2049_014mir", "source_sha256": "fec2cfbdc7dd2ffafe770bf44915021018bd6054c8c8a6f22c9bfe4b7e6914ca", "ja": "なるほど……！", "zh": "原来如此……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2050_p", "source_sha256": "1766eb95128cc910e964bfd03ffdff3dadb3b3103d3e3129096b413a7bf8581d", "ja": "（春香、先輩らしくアドバイスしているな。\n未来も、きちんと話を聞いているようだ）", "zh": "（春香给了很有前辈风范的建议，\n未来感觉也有认真在听。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_2051_016tsu", "source_sha256": "85573d0dbe52c8595a73566dabd7c7e8a2a4daa8c5286dc9443234efa71fffd7", "ja": "あ。そういえば春香さん、お仕事は？\nまだ出かけなくていいんですか～？", "zh": "啊，对了，春香不是还有工作？\n再不出门来得及吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
