{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "db9991aa70fb3ea9834b91c963feada91c7885d48185422e9d51c64feafa5700", "ja": "……あ～あ。春香さん、行っちゃったね～。", "zh": "……唉～春香出门了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3009_015siz", "source_sha256": "22c5252334c92c3cd67a1e1ce8080a82133284d86756251914f78329ff4ea0b0", "ja": "けど、答えは未来が知ってるって……\n一体、どういう意味なのかしら？", "zh": "不过，她说未来知道答案……\n这到底是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3010_014mir", "source_sha256": "d9d2e51e785d011d70030be0a84c35f834103e14c5ecb34e7a2fe88b3f392c28", "ja": "私……春香さんが最後に言ったこと、\nよくわからなかったよ～……。", "zh": "春香最后说的那句话……\n我也不是很懂耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3011_014mir", "source_sha256": "fe6e85084d2d8979821d76d49895a14acfbda4b895cf9c3b72db6690b6624f60", "ja": "うぅ、どうしよう……。", "zh": "唔，怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
