{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3018_p", "source_sha256": "6605575242c9e1db9c1055121d665024c3b6dd5f1dac581a09a4d24cee60c060", "ja": "未来は、ライブが楽しいって言ったよな。", "zh": "未来曾说过，演唱会很开心对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3019_014mir", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3020_p", "source_sha256": "e0d81d55f97c92fcd4eab3bad763412429eb785567fc4d0700f9018475933c1e", "ja": "じゃあ、未来は自分のステージを観たお客さん達に、\nどうなってほしいと思う？", "zh": "那未来希望看到自己表演的观众们，\n有什么样的感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3021_014mir", "source_sha256": "01947071b680d170f13e630bfae98f58eca7a69d7918ad4fc3876d27eda78029", "ja": "私のステージを観た人達に……ですか？", "zh": "看我表演的人……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3022_014mir", "source_sha256": "043ae93fa5dca7963677144be1be0ff84dff6f5dcaa0c877973c7a429a7f6ab0", "ja": "もちろん、キラキラでピカピカなステージに、\nドキドキして……。", "zh": "当然是希望他们看到闪亮耀眼的表演后，\n会觉得心跳不已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3023_014mir", "source_sha256": "ef622c9e57745df5f92da77c6833522be3eddeaa8ce8413e6c6cafdc9c0c2dcd", "ja": "それで、わーってなって、キャーってして！\nワクワク、ウキウキする感じで！", "zh": "然后心里很激动，想要尖叫！\n整个人都很兴奋、雀跃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3024_p", "source_sha256": "56219edf2ba97d8ff86bad11e57aa5bc9bfbe20a6f5fdae41b11799b497a57c8", "ja": "うんうん、いいぞ。\nそれで？", "zh": "嗯嗯，很好。\n所以？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3025_014mir", "source_sha256": "0670a03c408e4069f36a195c60210f191077d7397be18f93ba0c984db6899fe2", "ja": "それでそれで、えっと……。\nえっと……。", "zh": "所以、所以，我想想……\n我希望……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3027_014mir", "source_sha256": "8a18838cf275650cfc3ed425f8705049aa486e97ad005ff8c2d65dd2a495949b", "ja": "{$P$}さん。私、観に来てくれた\nお客さん達に、楽しいって思ってほしいかも……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生。我会希望\n来看我的观众们都能很开心，或许吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3028_p", "source_sha256": "e2276d9c4f7c68f9df6e59a26ec9232a7a32abf3bf2c0a9bb3af82e64e4d3dfe", "ja": "かも、でいいのか？", "zh": "或许，就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3029_014mir", "source_sha256": "cc6b8dae66dc166a5ef3ffb7f40b8f089585f65f57d88a2c3c9dfbb4a37cd590", "ja": "いっ、いえ！　思ってほしいです！　いっぱい、\nい～っぱい、楽しいって思ってほしいです！", "zh": "不、不对！我很肯定！\n我希望他们都非常、非～常的开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_3030", "source_sha256": "a85a122147e5630b26e2f8f6e2614a5983fd33d87c8c5ae60f4d83b50e88ce23", "ja": "それでいい！", "zh": "这就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_4000_p", "source_sha256": "70ae69c1958458d4080e129b5a44d64ad457412d3846d74ef5cd168387f41384", "ja": "それでいいんだ！　それじゃ、お客さんに、\nいっぱい楽しんでもらえるステージにしような！", "zh": "这就对了！那就要呈现出\n观众们会看得很开心的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_4001_014mir", "source_sha256": "46f7ebd9ba1fdecc7eccf46a426adec82033d591ae6af5f15a19152477574ed5", "ja": "そっか……。はいっ！　私、お客さん達に\nめいっぱい楽しんでもらえるように、頑張りますっ！", "zh": "原来是这样……好！\n我会努力让观众们都能开开心心、尽情享受！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_001_4002_p", "source_sha256": "02c2ae5d4c7f0181647c04c283cd6abb667e3f776c4417f07c3e019bfa15260b", "ja": "（初めてのセンターライブまで、あと少し……。\n劇場を笑顔で埋め尽くすために。頑張れ、未来！）", "zh": "（第一次当Center的演唱会就快到了……\n为了让剧场充满笑容，加油啊，未来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
